      ],
      "support": [
        {
          "citation_id": "E7:B9",
          "quote": "e-Commerce continued to be our main growth driver. Constant-currency e-Commerce GMV increased 28% year-over-year to KZT1.3 trillion ($2.6 billion), while purchases increased 33% year-over-year.",
          "exact_substring": true,
          "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1985487/000198548726000024/kspi-ex99_1.htm",
          "locator": "HTML text block 9"
        },
        {
          "citation_id": "E7:B74",
          "quote": "We\u2019re also seeing good results growing revenue from value-added services, namely advertising and delivery. During 2Q 2026, constant currency VAS revenue increased 49% year-over-year. As a result, e-Commerce 3P take rate increased 160 bps year-over-year to 16.1%, and e-Commerce revenue grew significantly faster than GMV. During 2Q 2026, e-Commerce revenue increased 35% year-over-year on a constant currency basis to KZT394 billion ($820 million).",
          "exact_substring": true,
          "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1985487/000198548726000024/kspi-ex99_1.htm",
